 Overriding Value Completion
 ---------------------------
 
+Options can enable built-in value strategies with
+``auto_complete=True``,
+which selects a strategy from the option name, or explicitly select
+``user``, ``branch``, ``environment``, ``file``, or ``directory``.
+An explicit ``shell_complete`` callback always takes precedence.
+
 Value completions for a parameter can be customized without a custom
 type by providing a ``shell_complete`` function. The function is used
 instead of any completion provided by the type. It is passed 3 keyword
